{
  "key": 50251,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "VerityCavern_Text_MespritCry",
      "en_US": "Kyauun.\r",
      "fr_FR": "Créééfollet.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "VerityCavern_Text_MespritFlewOff",
      "en_US": "MESPRIT flew off somewhere...\r",
      "fr_FR": "CREFOLLET s’est envolé...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "VerityCavern_Text_RowanThatWasMesprit",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: ...\n",
        "...\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, that was MESPRIT,\n",
        "wasn’t it?\r",
        "You’ve accomplished what I’d asked\n",
        "you to do at the Canalave Library...\r",
        "I asked you to get data on the\n",
        "Pokémon of the lake, and you did.\r",
        "But it didn’t provide any answers\n",
        "about the mysteries of evolution.\r",
        "I still don’t know why some Pokémon\n",
        "evolve and others don’t.\r",
        "Ultimately, it only deepened the\n",
        "mystery.\r",
        "But having mysteries to solve...\n",
        "That adds to my enjoyment!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: ...\n",
        "...\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, c’était CREFOLLET,\n",
        "n’est-ce pas?\r",
        "Tu as fait ce que je t’avais demandé à \n",
        "la Bibliothèque de Joliberges...\r",
        "Tu as pu trouver des informations \n",
        "sur les Pokémon du lac.\r",
        "Mais ça ne m’a pas apporté de réponse \n",
        "concernant les mystères de l’évolution.\r",
        "Je ne sais pas pourquoi certains \n",
        "Pokémon évoluent et d’autres non.\r",
        "En fait, le mystère est encore \n",
        "plus grand maintenant.\r",
        "Mais trouver la clé d’un grand \n",
        "mystère... Voilà un défi qui me plaît!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VerityCavern_Text_RowanChaseAfterMesprit",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, why don’t you chase\n",
        "after MESPRIT?\r",
        "To me, it seemed as if it wanted to\n",
        "play with you.\r",
        "If you were to use the Pokétch app\n",
        "Marking Map, you’d be able to\f",
        "track the movements of Pokémon.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, pourquoi tu ne \n",
        "poursuivrais pas CREFOLLET?\r",
        "J’ai comme l’impression qu’il \n",
        "avait envie de jouer avec toi.\r",
        "Tu pourrais le suivre à la trace grâce\n",
        "au logiciel Pokémontre Carte Repères.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VerityCavern_Text_RowanNoMarkingMap",
      "en_US": [
        "What?\n",
        "You don’t have the Marking Map?\r",
        "...You should occasionally pay visits\n",
        "to the Pokétch Company, you know.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Quoi?\n",
        "Tu n’as pas le logiciel Carte Repères?\r",
        "Tu devrais aller faire un tour à la\n",
        "Pokémontre S.A. de temps en temps...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VerityCavern_Text_RowanGoOn",
      "en_US": [
        "Go on, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "I’m sure that you will keep meeting\n",
        "countless Pokémon and people.\r",
        "Those encounters will keep thrilling\n",
        "you in their own special ways.\r",
        "I hope you’ll enjoy that experience!\n",
        "Take care, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Va, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Je suis sûr que tu vas rencontrer plein \n",
        "de gens et de Pokémon sur ta route.\r",
        "Tu vas voir comme ces \n",
        "découvertes sont enrichissantes.\r",
        "Je sens que cette vie va te plaire!\n",
        "Fais bien attention à toi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}